### Login Request

# @prompt username
@password=123

# @name Login
POST http://localhost:8080/login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "ponto": "{{username}}",
    "senha": "{{password}}"
}


@token={{Login.response.body.token}}

###  Get Countries
GET http://localhost:8080/countries HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Country
POST http://localhost:8080/countries HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###  Get Country Detail
GET http://localhost:8080/countries/detail HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###  Delete Country
DELETE http://localhost:8080/countries HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}